# Homebrew bundle -- the single source of truth for installed packages.
#
#   brew bundle --file homebrew/Brewfile            # install
#   brew bundle dump --force --file homebrew/Brewfile  # re-snapshot after adding things
#
# Every entry below was verified against formulae.brew.sh. Generated for
# Apple Silicon; on Intel, prefix paths are /usr/local instead of /opt/homebrew.

